+# Upstream baseline
+
+## libssh2
+
+- Repository: `https://github.com/libssh2/libssh2`
+- Commit: `a34302491c164d53c900fec9b3cbb050ecebe719`
+- Reported version: `1.11.2_DEV`
+- Archive: `https://codeload.github.com/libssh2/libssh2/tar.gz/a34302491c164d53c900fec9b3cbb050ecebe719`
+- Archive SHA-256: `744ba3e9a8e7a877038e94a74459340052a105ad599605a5b6d0d6bc5ec2c87c`
+- License: BSD-3-Clause; `COPYING` SHA-256
+  `a83a4da224ebeaaaea5efb4cd1ef1ab0998c1bd719d6f70b05e1d5c491372137`
+
+## OpenSSL
+
+- Release/tag: `openssl-3.5.7`
+- Commit: `8cf17aaeb4599f8af87fefd810b5b5fee90fe69e`
+- Archive: `https://github.com/openssl/openssl/releases/download/openssl-3.5.7/openssl-3.5.7.tar.gz`
+- Archive SHA-256: `a8c0d28a529ca480f9f36cf5792e2cd21984552a3c8e4aa11a24aa31aeac98e8`
+- License: Apache-2.0; `LICENSE.txt` SHA-256
+  `7d5450cb2d142651b8afa315b5f238efc805dad827d91ba367d8516bc9d49e7a`
+- `ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS.md` SHA-256:
+  `58dee45791f007ced048114717f86672778fe75c551827c57e760861446ce3c3`
+
+The XCFramework statically combines libssh2 with this OpenSSL libcrypto build.
+Runtime downloads are prohibited.
+
